    "long_instructions": "### Modify\r\n\r\n1. **Change the substring:** Change the code so it grabs the **last** 3 letters of `pet_name` instead. Run the program to test it.\r\n2. **Add a third ingredient:** Add a new variable for your **favorite movie, show or book** and update your improved `code_name` to include a substring from it too. Run your code to test it still works.\r\n3. **Add a numberic ingredient:** Add one more variable - your **favorite number**. Try adding it directly into your improved `code_name`. Run your code.\r\n4. **Fix the error:** Use `str()` to fix the error. Use AI Tutor to help you if needed. ",
    "encrypted_exemplar_sources": "A3vaHWcrNLyiKjVtNgHDFXFU4wUoGwMZZd5XD39qeii5wGPevnxczbgEwyFi\nWMD1VtUw+hiun2p9xPlDbE2m33rSwIF1oO1W9B9lPC7EzMp0lk46B79LGHyk\nY3uKhqOOIh04ZqItfdWm2PXDF2+B86bP6mppn2Is+fQf3jyyJLHOe78WlE0e\nLM9F5fQHwpqEXy8d47iiPDAO+TO+p0knjJOlo/II97OBWdH2NXjMi4Yr0CbT\nr1+6HTkEGnPGR7B+UqvSa6MhEgjMbaMAWTDyq0WH+ZXmXjLxBdfW9w8fa/Y7\nt5CwjOOEqankn6X6C/4gyE4V6/rnGEBJxf+kbDNHVe4kpl1aocTw3JgotuEg\neZiaklj7bfc7MSmK+3h+shMC570ZudVYlUBUZ46/MBRKMGh/Uu/DvVXG6ZbL\nTr/BBMGxWcPwW2i407/ck3S01VZGG0wq08XbuBff7arbzIcJO7wE5BBGp6Fq\n2JTE69qjptsyJEM2EqW/0Hf16z+h12rzTUkBEDNqS8Aa/dnqm0lEGcg9nEjK\nHCPmtXle1CUa2q/1sYGgIVOt8j/DEi9owi5qE6WdcVunSLg9F4NWui+jBQKs\njwPuWfGZyZOQWoFCq70TIpRSRZXtgoBz2PoQwecy/3hnA4RM1RZcL1SPw7ms\nrR3CqlZ68iH7ra0wBTRnnf+QZ4bsNlyMUkGgT9dO+/BVkYh8GOJn8cX+sHR3\n+KY/tR0CQn6CLmQkHbspfjmgRFM=\n",
